Tunguska — original project

Viktor Lofgren — designed and implemented Tunguska, its original emulator,
assembler, guest operating system and experimental 3CC compiler.
Original copyright notices and contributors' Git history are retained.
https://github.com/vlofgren/tunguska
https://tunguska.sourceforge.net/

